not he remains but kang  the new kang variant who took over from  he remains and stole the he remains  corpse's master tim pad from the citadel  i actually theorized that that original  temp pad might be the thing that was  stolen from kang that kang now wants  scott lang to steal back for him in the  quantum mania footage loki tells us that  he's been pulled through time and saw  terrible awful things which is new  because that had not happened to him  when he arrived in the rebooted tva in  the season 1 finale and loki says it'll  sound strange which has got to be at  least a wink from the writers to us  referencing doctor strange in avengers  infinity war who pulled himself through  time using the time stone to look at 14  605 futures and was horrified by what he  saw sounds like this is what has now  happened to loki since he arrived in  this new tba the kang who lords over it  has used a temp pad to pull him forward  in time and show him all the horrifying  things that kang plans to do to the mcu  loki goes on to describe this saying  this is about everything there is  nothing to stand between this world and  utter destruction war is on its way so  why would kang tell his war plan to loki  i mean why does any bond villain tell  his hero the plans ahead of time is kang  doing this just to screw with loki or is  loki knowing the madness to come part of  kang's plan like the oracle of delphi  telling oedipus his fate kang could have  cursed loki with knowledge of the future  in order to bring kang's enemies  together in a specific self-fulfilling  prophecy making them easier to pick off  in kang dynasty and in secret wars  remember thanos told iron man we were  both cursed with knowledge knowledge of  the future is a kind of curse because it  forces you to accidentally walk down  that path in this footage we see loki  using a tv8 time stick to prune away a  mural showing the time keepers to reveal  multiple giant golden faces of kang  behind that mural each of them roughly  the size of the timekeeper paces that we  saw in the courtroom so i don't know if  this would be the same tva that loki  ended season one inside of because that  tva had already replaced all the  iconography of the timekeepers with kang  stuff and there would be no reason to  hide any kang iconography with the  facade of timekeepers here so this must  be either the original tva that loki  departed or a third tva that loki has  now traveled to which would be why this  now nightmarish one is so empty probably  the biggest announcement for the loki  panel is that kihui kwan is joining the  season 2 cast kwon just made a glorious  comeback and everything everywhere all  at once after his iconic roles as a  child actor in goonies and temple of  doom this trailer footage reveals he is  playing a kind of record keeper or  archivist who floats down through a  vault location to meet loki at a help  desk the whole moment feels like  something out of terry gilliam's brazil  then casey the tva clerk played by  eugene cardero will return in season two  because the new shot shows him panicked  crawling through a dark cramped space  like under the floorboards or an event  we also see a shot of sylvie lounging on  a sofa listening to vinyl records we do  know that characters will travel to  london in the 1970s we also saw a shot  of silvie wearing a 1970s mcdonald's  uniform and set imagery so that can be  connected to that but various new parts  of the tva are shown including a bright  room filled with natural light pouring  in from the outside with rounded  archways overhead we're just gonna have  to wait for the trailer to officially  drop online for me to break it down  properly but there is a shot of a  monster claw grabbing at the door of the  tva and this actually could tell us what  is going on and why the tva is so empty  so nightmarish like something out of a  horror movie because i broke down the  trailer for werewolf by night and that  footage includes some armored guards who  do kind of look like tva hunters i guess  their helmets aren't exactly the same  and their prods electrocute rather than  prune but remember mobius did mention a  nightmare department in loki episode 1.  this place is a nightmare that's another  department now that department i'll help  you burn down  in episode 4 double down on the tva  having dealt with supernatural threats  like vampires you know we brought in  cree  titans vampires why is it the two orphan  demigods are such a pain in the ass so  who knows werewolf by night could be  taking place in the tva's nightmare  department a department where  supernatural elements prune from the  timeline all live and are stored but now  with all the changes that have happened  to the tva from loki's season one that  department has gotten destabilized and  the monsters have broken loose like  something out of cabin in the woods and  that could result in this creepy  nightmarish tva that loki is now  glitching through now on another shot  loki and mobius are wearing vintage  tuxedos and mobius says a little over  the top don't you think i thought it was  sportone and we also see that there are  multiple variants of tom hiddleston loki  in this conversation and the trailer  ends with loki and mobius together  chatting and loki says i don't want you  to think i'm the bad guy in all this  mobius says who says you were iron man  captain america hulk black widow hawkeye  phil coulson thanos nick fury my father  my brother miss minutes you moby's just  drugs and conceits  it's always great to hear phil coulson's  name in the mcu because we've got to  show this man more respect but it's  interesting that loki says thanos called  him the bad guy at some point because  this loki departed from the sacred  timeline in 2012 in the battle of new  york in the first avengers film and  while this loki watched footage of his  future timeline into that future we  never really saw thanos calling loki a  villain so this must be a hint at  whatever thanos told loki when he first  sent him to conquer irv off-screen loki  also mentions miss minutes who in the  citadel offered him a chance to kind of  restore his place in the timeline  bringing her up here reminds us that she  is an active player in this world with a  role to play in season two is she the  thing that kang lost that scott lang  must steal back in quanah mania and what  exactly is miss minutes is she an ai  holo projection is she a sentient cosmic  being of some kind is she time itself  captured in this cute form let me know  your thoughts down below and follow me  on tik tok instagram and twitter avos  subscribe to new rockstars for more  analysis of everything you love thanks  for watching bye  [Music]  you

